"Nothing Helm runs can hang. Homebrew, the VPN list and the power settings are read by running the system's own tools, and a tool that was talkative enough about its own warnings could stop forever, taking the screen waiting for it with it." = "Nada do que o Helm executa pode travar. Uma ferramenta suficientemente verbosa nos próprios avisos podia parar para sempre e levar junto a tela que a aguardava.";
"Nothing in this folder matches yet." = "Por ora nada nesta pasta corresponde.";
